*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*%
*% Matica XID8300 retransfer card printer - CUPS raster driver.
*% Filter: rastertoxid8300, backend: xid8300://host[:port]
*%
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "0.1"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "XID8300.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Matica"
*Product: "(XID8300)"
*ModelName: "Matica XID8300"
*ShortNickName: "Matica XID8300"
*NickName: "Matica XID8300 card printer, rastertoxid8300"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: RGB
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.2
*cupsModelNumber: 8300
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsBackSide: Normal
*cupsFilter2: "application/vnd.cups-raster application/vnd.matica-xid8300 100 rastertoxid8300"

*% Colour-correction cube from the Windows driver; not included, import it with xid8300-import.
*xidLUTFile: "/var/lib/printer-driver-xid8300/LUT24.LUT"


*OpenGroup: General/General

*% 1036 x 664 dots at 300 dpi (docs/PROTOCOL.md 1.5).
*OpenUI *PageSize/Card Orientation: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: CR80
*PageSize CR80/Landscape (CR80): "<</PageSize[248.64 159.36]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize CR80Portrait/Portrait (CR80), e.g. ID cards: "<</PageSize[159.36 248.64]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: CR80
*PageRegion CR80/Landscape (CR80): "<</PageSize[248.64 159.36]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion CR80Portrait/Portrait (CR80), e.g. ID cards: "<</PageSize[159.36 248.64]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 300dpi
*Resolution 300dpi/300 DPI: "<</HWResolution[300 300]/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsColorSpace 1>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Colour Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: RGB
*ColorModel RGB/Colour: "<</cupsColorSpace 1/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsBitsPerColor 8>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*OpenUI *Duplex/Print on Both Sides: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Duplex
*DefaultDuplex: None
*Duplex None/Off (front only): "<</Duplex false/Tumble false>>setpagedevice"
*Duplex DuplexNoTumble/On (page 1 front, page 2 back): "<</Duplex true/Tumble false>>setpagedevice"
*Duplex DuplexTumble/On, back turned 180: "<</Duplex true/Tumble true>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Duplex

*% Image size: like the Windows driver, the page is scaled to the full print area
*% (1036 x 664 dots, a little larger than the card) so the card is printed edge to edge.
*OpenUI *CardFit/Image Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *CardFit
*DefaultCardFit: Fill
*CardFit Fill/Fill the card edge to edge: ""
*CardFit Actual/Actual size, centred: ""
*CloseUI: *CardFit

*% Image position correction for the printer, in mm (applies to both sides).
*% Directions are as seen on a landscape card. For a portrait design, "up" moves the
*% image towards the right edge of the design and "right" towards its bottom edge.
*OpenUI *ImageShiftX/Move Image Left/Right: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *ImageShiftX
*DefaultImageShiftX: 0
*ImageShiftX -3.00/3.00 mm left: ""
*ImageShiftX -2.75/2.75 mm left: ""
*ImageShiftX -2.50/2.50 mm left: ""
*ImageShiftX -2.25/2.25 mm left: ""
*ImageShiftX -2.00/2.00 mm left: ""
*ImageShiftX -1.75/1.75 mm left: ""
*ImageShiftX -1.50/1.50 mm left: ""
*ImageShiftX -1.25/1.25 mm left: ""
*ImageShiftX -1.00/1.00 mm left: ""
*ImageShiftX -0.75/0.75 mm left: ""
*ImageShiftX -0.50/0.50 mm left: ""
*ImageShiftX -0.25/0.25 mm left: ""
*ImageShiftX 0/No change: ""
*ImageShiftX 0.25/0.25 mm right: ""
*ImageShiftX 0.50/0.50 mm right: ""
*ImageShiftX 0.75/0.75 mm right: ""
*ImageShiftX 1.00/1.00 mm right: ""
*ImageShiftX 1.25/1.25 mm right: ""
*ImageShiftX 1.50/1.50 mm right: ""
*ImageShiftX 1.75/1.75 mm right: ""
*ImageShiftX 2.00/2.00 mm right: ""
*ImageShiftX 2.25/2.25 mm right: ""
*ImageShiftX 2.50/2.50 mm right: ""
*ImageShiftX 2.75/2.75 mm right: ""
*ImageShiftX 3.00/3.00 mm right: ""
*CloseUI: *ImageShiftX

*OpenUI *ImageShiftY/Move Image Up/Down: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *ImageShiftY
*DefaultImageShiftY: 0
*ImageShiftY -3.00/3.00 mm up: ""
*ImageShiftY -2.75/2.75 mm up: ""
*ImageShiftY -2.50/2.50 mm up: ""
*ImageShiftY -2.25/2.25 mm up: ""
*ImageShiftY -2.00/2.00 mm up: ""
*ImageShiftY -1.75/1.75 mm up: ""
