*ImageShiftY 1.25/1.25 mm down: ""
*ImageShiftY 1.50/1.50 mm down: ""
*ImageShiftY 1.75/1.75 mm down: ""
*ImageShiftY 2.00/2.00 mm down: ""
*ImageShiftY 2.25/2.25 mm down: ""
*ImageShiftY 2.50/2.50 mm down: ""
*ImageShiftY 2.75/2.75 mm down: ""
*ImageShiftY 3.00/3.00 mm down: ""
*CloseUI: *ImageShiftY

*% Windows Setup page. Needs the card turnover unit.
*OpenUI *TurnOverAfterLoad/Turn Over the Card After Loading: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *TurnOverAfterLoad
*DefaultTurnOverAfterLoad: False
*TurnOverAfterLoad False/No: ""
*TurnOverAfterLoad True/Yes: ""
*CloseUI: *TurnOverAfterLoad

*% Two-sided cards only.
*OpenUI *BackSideFirst/Print the Back Side First: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *BackSideFirst
*DefaultBackSideFirst: False
*BackSideFirst False/No: ""
*BackSideFirst True/Yes: ""
*CloseUI: *BackSideFirst

*CloseGroup: General

*OpenGroup: Print/Print

*% Panels per side. With a UV choice the next page of the document is the UV layer.
*OpenUI *FrontPanels/Front Side Print Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *FrontPanels
*DefaultFrontPanels: YMCK
*FrontPanels YMC/YMC: ""
*FrontPanels K/K (resin black only): ""
*FrontPanels YMCK/YMCK: ""
*FrontPanels YMCUV/YMC + UV (next page): ""
*FrontPanels KUV/K + UV (next page): ""
*FrontPanels YMCKUV/YMCK + UV (next page): ""
*CloseUI: *FrontPanels

*OpenUI *BackPanels/Back Side Print Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *BackPanels
*DefaultBackPanels: YMCK
*BackPanels YMC/YMC: ""
*BackPanels K/K (resin black only): ""
*BackPanels YMCK/YMCK: ""
*BackPanels YMCUV/YMC + UV (next page): ""
*BackPanels KUV/K + UV (next page): ""
*BackPanels YMCKUV/YMCK + UV (next page): ""
*CloseUI: *BackPanels

*% Windows "Using of Resin K ink". Text cannot be told apart in a raster, so "Only text" is
*% approximated by extracting pure black; "With YMC ink" keeps the colour under it.
*OpenUI *BlackMode/Using of Resin K Ink: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *BlackMode
*DefaultBlackMode: KPlusColor
*BlackMode KOnly/Extraction, K only (no YMC under black): ""
*BlackMode KPlusColor/Extraction, with YMC ink: ""
*BlackMode Composite/No extraction (black from YMC): ""
*CloseUI: *BlackMode

*OpenUI *BlackThreshold/Treat as Black: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *BlackThreshold
*DefaultBlackThreshold: 0
*BlackThreshold 0/Exactly 0,0,0: ""
*BlackThreshold 16/Channels 16 or less: ""
*BlackThreshold 32/Channels 32 or less: ""
*CloseUI: *BlackThreshold

*OpenUI *MonoMethod/K-Only Side Rendering: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *MonoMethod
*DefaultMonoMethod: Threshold
*MonoMethod Threshold/Threshold at 50%: ""
*MonoMethod Dither/Error diffusion: ""
*CloseUI: *MonoMethod

*OpenUI *FrontRotate180/Rotate Front 180: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *FrontRotate180
*DefaultFrontRotate180: False
*FrontRotate180 False/No: ""
*FrontRotate180 True/Yes: ""
*CloseUI: *FrontRotate180

*OpenUI *BackRotate180/Rotate Back 180: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *BackRotate180
*DefaultBackRotate180: False
*BackRotate180 False/No: ""
*BackRotate180 True/Yes: ""
*CloseUI: *BackRotate180

*% UV ink page of the Windows driver; sent with the UV plane.
*OpenUI *UVMarkPosition/UV Mark Position: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *UVMarkPosition
*DefaultUVMarkPosition: UpperRight
*UVMarkPosition UpperRight/Upper right: ""
*UVMarkPosition LowerLeft/Lower left: ""
*CloseUI: *UVMarkPosition

*OpenUI *UVFilmPanels/UV Retransfer Film Panels: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *UVFilmPanels
*DefaultUVFilmPanels: Two
*UVFilmPanels Two/2 panels: ""
*UVFilmPanels One/1 panel: ""
*UVFilmPanels Auto/Auto: ""
*CloseUI: *UVFilmPanels

*CloseGroup: Print

