*OpenGroup: Encode/Encode

*% Magnetic stripe: track data comes from the job options mag-track1/2/3 and mag-jis2.
*% True sends job-header value 0x11 (card flag toggled after encoding); meaning unconfirmed.
*OpenUI *MagCardFlip/Flip Card After Magnetic Encoding: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *MagCardFlip
*DefaultMagCardFlip: False
*MagCardFlip False/No: ""
*MagCardFlip True/Yes: ""
*CloseUI: *MagCardFlip

*% Smart card: data comes from the job options ic-contact / ic-contactless and is handed to
*% the encoding programs in the backend's xid8300 directory. True sends job-header value
*% 0x11/0x21 (card flag toggled after IC encoding); meaning unconfirmed.
*OpenUI *ICCardFlip/Flip Card After Smart-Card Encoding: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *ICCardFlip
*DefaultICCardFlip: False
*ICCardFlip False/No: ""
*ICCardFlip True/Yes: ""
*CloseUI: *ICCardFlip

*OpenUI *MagWriteRetry/Magnetic Write Retry: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *MagWriteRetry
*DefaultMagWriteRetry: Default
*MagWriteRetry Default/Printer setting: ""
*MagWriteRetry 0/0: ""
*MagWriteRetry 1/1: ""
*MagWriteRetry 2/2: ""
*MagWriteRetry 3/3: ""
*CloseUI: *MagWriteRetry

*OpenUI *MagCoercivity/Magnetic Coercivity: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *MagCoercivity
*DefaultMagCoercivity: Default
*MagCoercivity Default/Printer setting: ""
*MagCoercivity LoCo/Lo-Co: ""
*MagCoercivity HiCo/Hi-Co: ""
*CloseUI: *MagCoercivity

*% Encode the magnetic stripe / chip before the card is printed.
*OpenUI *EncodeBeforePrint/Print After Encoding: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *EncodeBeforePrint
*DefaultEncodeBeforePrint: False
*EncodeBeforePrint False/No: ""
*EncodeBeforePrint True/Yes: ""
*CloseUI: *EncodeBeforePrint

*CloseGroup: Encode

*OpenGroup: Laminate/Laminate

*% Only for printers with a laminator.
*OpenUI *LaminateMode/Laminate Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *LaminateMode
*DefaultLaminateMode: Default
*LaminateMode Default/Printer setting: ""
*LaminateMode Laminate/Laminate: ""
*LaminateMode PassThrough/Pass through: ""
*CloseUI: *LaminateMode

*CloseGroup: Laminate

*OpenGroup: InstallableOptions/Installed Options

*OpenUI *MagEncoderType/Magnetic Encoder: PickOne
*DefaultMagEncoderType: ISO
*MagEncoderType ISO/ISO: ""
*MagEncoderType JIS/JIS: ""
*CloseUI: *MagEncoderType

*CloseGroup: InstallableOptions

*DefaultImageableArea: CR80
*ImageableArea CR80/Landscape (CR80): "0 0 248.64 159.36"
*ImageableArea CR80Portrait/Portrait (CR80), e.g. ID cards: "0 0 159.36 248.64"
*DefaultPaperDimension: CR80
*PaperDimension CR80/Landscape (CR80): "248.64 159.36"
*PaperDimension CR80Portrait/Portrait (CR80), e.g. ID cards: "159.36 248.64"

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(002.004S)" Standard ROM
*% End of xid8300.ppd
